window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-003-e92365e492e09795.json"]={sha256:"e92365e492e09795252a6a128bb10decbb70b750497f513370265016ef6d5b01",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-4b7dcc9d14961511","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-08449-y","title":"Quantum error correction below the surface code threshold","titleEn":"Quantum error correction below the surface code threshold","publisher":"Google Quantum AI and collaborators, Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-003","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-003","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-004","referenceUrls":["https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/running-quantum-circuits"],"title":"Qiskit T1：能量鬆弛與重置等待","titleEn":"Qiskit T1: energy relaxation and reset waiting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付洩漏與時間雙軸比較、初態基線及三能階模型升級需求。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver a leakage/time comparison, initial-state baseline and requirements for a three-level model. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Qiskit T1：能量鬆弛與重置等待』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付半對數衰減圖、平台診斷及重置時間預算。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Qiskit T1: energy relaxation and reset waiting', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver a semilog decay plot, plateau diagnosis and reset-time budget.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：用弱驅動上界代理 L=(Ω/Δ)²；Ω與非目標失諧Δ同單位。此值不是完整三能階門誤差。 使用合成Ω/2π=10 MHz、非目標Δ/2π=200 MHz，取比值時2π抵消。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(10/200)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查振幅減半使平方代理減至四分之一，而不是一半；另列退相干時間尚未納入。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：單指數能量鬆弛 P1(t)=exp(−t/T1)；此處假設初態完全激發且熱平衡激發率為零。 使用教學 T1=100 μs、等待t=50 μs；先不加入準備與讀出誤差。 以手算或試算表計算名義式exp(-50/100)，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以log(P1)對時間斜率驗證−1/T1；兩點比值應為exp(−0.5)。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Use weak-drive proxy L=(Ω/Δ)² with matching frequency units; it is not a complete three-level gate error. Use Synthetic Ω/2π=10 MHz and unwanted Δ/2π=200 MHz;2π cancels in the ratio. Evaluate nominal expression (10/200)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check that halving amplitude quarters the squared proxy; separately list omitted decoherence time.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Single-exponential relaxation P1(t)=exp(−t/T1) assumes full initial excitation and zero equilibrium excitation. Use Teaching T1=100 μs and wait t=50 μs; preparation and readout errors are initially excluded. Evaluate nominal expression exp(-50/100) by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check slope−1/T1 in log(P1) versus time; the two-point ratio should be exp(−0.5).","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-013","referenceUrls":["https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204"],"title":"超導讀出共振器：Q 值與線寬","titleEn":"Superconducting readout resonator: quality factor and linewidth","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付洩漏與時間雙軸比較、初態基線及三能階模型升級需求。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver a leakage/time comparison, initial-state baseline and requirements for a three-level model. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『超導讀出共振器：Q 值與線寬』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付功率頻譜、Q反算與內外損耗區分表。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Superconducting readout resonator: quality factor and linewidth', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver power spectra, inverse Q and an internal/external loss distinction table.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：用弱驅動上界代理 L=(Ω/Δ)²；Ω與非目標失諧Δ同單位。此值不是完整三能階門誤差。 使用合成Ω/2π=10 MHz、非目標Δ/2π=200 MHz，取比值時2π抵消。 以手算或試算表計算名義式(10/200)**2，另開一欄執行獨立核對：檢查振幅減半使平方代理減至四分之一，而不是一半；另列退相干時間尚未納入。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：載入Q=f0/Δf；Δf為功率半高全寬。不能把振幅半高寬或角頻率混用。 使用合成f0=6 GHz、Q=10000；頻寬以MHz表示。 以手算或試算表計算名義式6e9/10000/1e6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：由兩個半功率頻點相減得到Δf，再反算Q；檢查掃頻解析度至少小於0.06 MHz。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Use weak-drive proxy L=(Ω/Δ)² with matching frequency units; it is not a complete three-level gate error. Use Synthetic Ω/2π=10 MHz and unwanted Δ/2π=200 MHz;2π cancels in the ratio. Evaluate nominal expression (10/200)**2 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check that halving amplitude quarters the squared proxy; separately list omitted decoherence time.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Loaded Q=f0/Δf with power full width at half maximum; do not substitute amplitude half-height width or angular frequency. Use Synthetic f0=6 GHz and Q=10000; express bandwidth in MHz. Evaluate nominal expression 6e9/10000/1e6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Subtract half-power frequencies to obtain Δf and invert Q; require sweep resolution below0.06 MHz.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-2f38936396021379","url":"https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice/running-quantum-circuits","title":"Running quantum circuits","titleEn":"Running quantum circuits","publisher":"IBM Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-a3054099b553bbb6","url":"https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.2.040204","title":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","titleEn":"Superconducting Circuit Companion—an Introduction with Worked Examples","publisher":"Rasmussen et al., PRX Quantum","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
